<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><title>General Blog</title><id>https://www.charlotte-thomas.me/blog/</id><updated>2025-03-20T00:00:00+00:00</updated><author><name>Charlotte Thomas</name><uri>https://www.charlotte-thomas.me</uri></author><generator uri="https://github.com/SabrinaJewson/sabrinajewson.github.io">sabrinajewson.github.io</generator><icon>https://www.charlotte-thomas.me/apple-touch-icon.png</icon><link href="https://www.charlotte-thomas.me/blog/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://www.charlotte-thomas.me/blog/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/><entry><title>Hello World!</title><id>https://www.charlotte-thomas.me/blog/first_post</id><updated>2025-03-20T00:00:00+00:00</updated><link href="https://www.charlotte-thomas.me/blog/first_post" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Hello World!"/><published>2025-03-20T00:00:00+00:00</published><content xml:base="https://www.charlotte-thomas.me/blog/first_post" type="html">&lt;h2 id=&apos;intro&apos;&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;#intro&apos; class=&apos;anchor&apos;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Intro&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to my &lt;em&gt;blog&lt;/em&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have been running a &lt;a href=&apos;https://writing.charlotte-thomas.me/blog&apos;&gt;writing blog&lt;/a&gt; for quite some time now but I thought it was &lt;em&gt;finally&lt;/em&gt; time to restart my general blog!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id=&apos;content&apos;&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;#content&apos; class=&apos;anchor&apos;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Content&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here you will find, amongst other things.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Software I discovered&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hardware (rarer)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Linux configuration &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Gay/LGBTI+ shit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;And whatever I want to write &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;What you &lt;em&gt;won’t&lt;/em&gt; find though (except for some announcements) are any news about my writing. All the writing stuff is on my &lt;a href=&apos;https://writing.charlotte-thomas.me&apos;&gt;writing page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id=&apos;services&apos;&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;#services&apos; class=&apos;anchor&apos;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Services&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can see the services I run on the &lt;a href=&apos;https://uptime.faefox.dev&apos;&gt;uptime page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the moment of writing I run:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On my Hetzner server&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;A &lt;a href=&apos;https://git.charlotte-thomas.me&apos;&gt;forgejo instance and runner&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A Conduwuit matrix server (&lt;em&gt;faefox.dev&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A &lt;a href=&apos;https://client.faefox.dev&apos;&gt;Cinny matrix client instance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;On CloudFare pagte&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;This &lt;a href=&apos;https://charlotte-thomas.me&apos;&gt;website and blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;a href=&apos;https://writing.charlotte-thomas.me&apos;&gt;writing website and blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;a href=&apos;https://calc.charlotte-thomas.me&apos;&gt;calc’s website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id=&apos;roadmap&apos;&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;#roadmap&apos; class=&apos;anchor&apos;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Roadmap&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;My current TODO list:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implementing an online reader on my writing website (see GitHub)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Making a website at &lt;strong&gt;faefox.dev&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;My novel (updates can be found on the writing blog)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</content></entry></feed>